# Port patch 0349 (2026-11-25, Т1 of docs/25-cuts-full.md): the foot shadow quads of one DrawFootShadow as one draw -
# one quad record (re4_gx_put_quads, as patch 0339 v2) with the channel's ambient and material from the vertex
# ((a, a, a, a) per quad: the same product as the registers gave); afterwards the state the last quad left.
# RE4_SHD_BATCH=0: a GXBegin per quad as before; 2 / 3: as before / batched, with counts in the log every 300 frames.
diff -ruN a/src/game/foot_shadow.cpp b/src/game/foot_shadow.cpp
